the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the Alter des Antragstellers of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    the Jahreseinkommen of *a case* is *a number*; scenario element.
    Kreditwürdigkeit prüfen holds for *a case*.
    Mindestalter erfüllt holds for *a case*.
    Einkommen ausreichend holds for *a case*.
    Mindestalter erfüllt would hold for *a case*; unknown.
    Einkommen ausreichend would hold for *a case*; unknown.

the knowledge base r4_1_inline_mode includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/inline-mode.ruml".

Kreditwürdigkeit prüfen holds for a case if
    Mindestalter erfüllt holds for the case
    and Einkommen ausreichend holds for the case.

Mindestalter erfüllt holds for a case if
    the Alter des Antragstellers of the case is a number N
    and N >= 18.

Mindestalter erfüllt holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Alter des Antragstellers of the case is a number
    and Mindestalter erfüllt would hold for the case.

Einkommen ausreichend holds for a case if
    the Jahreseinkommen of the case is a number N
    and N >= 30000.

Einkommen ausreichend holds for a case if
    it is not the case that the Jahreseinkommen of the case is a number
    and Einkommen ausreichend would hold for the case.

